    ],
    "description": "Crystal and Fossil Specimen Collection\nMixed Geological and Paleontological Lot\nNatural Materials, 10.6 lbs Total Weight\nAn extensive and diverse collection of geological specimens and prehistoric fossils, offering a wide array of educational and decorative pieces. This lot features a balanced mix of raw crystalline formations, professionally identified fossils, and polished mineral specimens, making it an excellent starter set for a new collector or a significant addition to an existing display.\nFossil Cave Bear Molar (Ursus spelaeus) from the Pleistocene era, found in Romania\nLarge Amethyst geode and Quartz crystal geode specimens\nTwo Trilobite fossils preserved in rocky matrix and one Osteichthyes (Bony Fish) fossil\nFossilized Coprolite (Dinosaur Poop) and a collection of small shark teeth in a display case\nLarge assortment of tumbled polished stones including rose quartz, tiger's eye, and carnelian\nSignificant quantity of Pyrite (Fool's Gold) clusters and various raw mineral specimens\nCondition:\nThe collection is in good condition as natural specimens. The Cave Bear Molar is well-preserved with an intact identification card. Geodes show sharp crystalline structures with typical exterior matrix wear. Fossils exhibit clear details relative to their species. Tumbled stones are highly polished with minimal surface bruising. Coprolite is contained in protective packaging. Pyrite clusters show characteristic metallic luster.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
